[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis 3 — input shape of the one argument (`int`):** zero / positive / negative,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m small magnitude / maximum magnitude, one step inside each range end, and
