[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis 4 — accumulated global state.** This is the real second dimension of the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m configuration surface. `static house_t the_house` (`driver.c:35`) is *persistent
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m and mutable*, and every `run` mutates all three of its fields:
